OL,3,GNEWSAEfforts under way to get
OL,4,Alighthouse working again
OL,5,
OL,6,FEfforts are under way to get a historic
OL,7,Flighthouse working again after a
OL,8,Ftwo-tonne cable was ripped out in a
OL,9,Fstorm.
OL,11,FWhitehaven Harbour Commissioners closed
OL,12,Fits west pier last week after the cable
OL,13,Frunning along the harbour wall was
OL,14,Fripped out amid Storm Boelo, dropping
OL,15,Finto the water.
OL,17,FThe 1839 lighthouse was restored three
OL,18,Fyears ago along with its twin north
OL,19,Fpier structure, at a cost of more than
OL,20,F#140,000.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
