OL,3,GNEWSAEfforts under way to get
OL,4,Alighthouse working again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA harbour commissioners spokesperson
OL,7,Furged people to keep away from the pier
OL,8,Fbecause nights were getting darker and
OL,9,Fthe exposed cable presented "a very
OL,10,Freal hazard".
